This product builds on, and contains no modified copies of, two works by
Anatoly Yakovenko licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  percolator       https://github.com/aeyakovenko/percolator
                   the v16 account-local risk engine (Rust crate)
  percolator-prog  https://github.com/aeyakovenko/percolator-prog
                   the Solana program that wraps the engine

Predictulator is a client-side system: TypeScript layouts, instruction
encoders, and services that talk to an unmodified deployment of
percolator-prog. Account layouts and instruction formats in packages/sdk
were transcribed from the source of those projects at the commits recorded
in packages/sdk/src/constants.ts.

